# Keeps the DAG processor away from files that are code, not DAG definitions.
# Every DAG folder holds its own core/ (pure logic) and adapters.py (I/O), and every
# domain an assets.py (the Assets its DAGs exchange) — none defines a DAG, so parsing
# them every ~30s would be pure waste.
# Syntax is glob (AIRFLOW__CORE__DAG_IGNORE_FILE_SYNTAX=glob in docker-compose.yml).
**/core/**
**/adapters.py
**/README.md
**/assets.py
